      "x": 70,
      "y": 125,
      "text": "1. make build-agent-linux\n   (cross-compile, CGO_DISABLED)\n\n2. make build-hub\n   (native compile)\n\n3. cd infra/terraform\n   terraform apply\n   → Creates 47 instances\n   → Uploads binaries (SSH)\n   → Creates systemd units\n   → Starts services",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 4
